extends ../layouts/main
block content
  section.page-hero
    .container
      span.eyebrow About us
      h1 A school built around the promise of education
      p Louise Junior School is a high-quality, low-cost education model school.
  section.py-5
    .container.narrow-content
      h2 Who we are
      p Louise Junior School works to provide children with the foundations for reading and mathematics, academic support, mentorship and extracurricular activities that positively influence their success throughout life.
      h2.mt-5 Our purpose
      p We aim for every learner to reach or exceed class proficiency in literacy and numeracy and to receive a practical, relevant education that prepares them to thrive in life.
      h2.mt-5 The need we address
      p Quality education helps children develop skills, confidence and opportunities. We are committed to strengthening learning, especially where families and communities face barriers to educational quality.
      h2.mt-5 How we work
      p Our approach includes learner-centred teaching, linking classroom content to real-life experiences, peer learning, co-curricular activities, teacher development and constructive engagement with parents.
